    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> that potentially converts the value handed to\n<a href=\"#setProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Object)\"><code>setProperty(PersistentProperty, Object)</code></a> to the type of the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> using a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>. Exposes <a href=\"#getProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Class)\"><code>getProperty(PersistentProperty, Class)</code></a> to allow obtaining the value of a\nproperty in a type the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> can convert the raw type to.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> 可能会将传递给 <a href=\"#setProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Object)\"><code>setProperty(PersistentProperty, Object)</code></a> 的值转换为与 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 类型匹配的类型，该转换通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 实现。它提供 <a href=\"#getProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Class)\"><code>getProperty(PersistentProperty, Class)</code></a> 方法，允许获取属性的值，该值可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 能够将原始类型转换为目标类型的任何类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
