    {
      "source": "Returns the value of the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> potentially applying type conversion to the given target\ntype.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>的值，并可能将结果转换为指定的目标类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> to the given value.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>设置为给定值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the underlying bean. The actual instance may change between\n<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html#setProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Object)\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor.setProperty(PersistentProperty, Object)</code></a> calls.",
